{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19667","headline":"道州弘道县主簿知县三年颇着廉慎秩满县阙申使请留将赴衡州题其厅事 · 吕温","name":"道州弘道县主簿知县三年颇着廉慎秩满县阙申使请留将赴衡州题其厅事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲理赖同力，陟明非所任。\n废田方垦草，新柘未成阴。\n术浅功难就，人疲感易深。\n烦君驻归棹，与慰不欺心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}